<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIAN CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JULY 4/7.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIAN CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JULY 4/7.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania on Friday</p>
<p>set the following currency fixings for Monday, July 7. The litas</p>
<p>is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   07.07.97	  04.07.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.7480	    6.6980</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.2879	    2.2808</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.5022	    4.4882</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.5328	    3.4996</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5184	    0.5143</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7685	    0.7656</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2866	    0.2866</p>
<p>    LAT	  7.0206	    6.9838</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6910	    0.6910</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2157	    1.2148</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
